.ad l
.\" -----------------------------------------------------------------
.\" * MAIN CONTENT STARTS HERE *
.\" -----------------------------------------------------------------
.SH "نام (NAME)"
grdctl \- Command line tool for configuring GNOME Remote Desktop
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
\fBgrdctl\fR [\fIOPTION\fR\&...] [\fICOMMAND\fR] [\fISUBCOMMAND\fR\&...]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
grdctl provides methods for configuring the GNOME Remote Desktop service, for example setting credentials\&.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.PP
\fB\-\-help\fR
.RS 4
Show help text\&.
.RE
.SH "GENERAL COMMANDS"
.PP
\fBstatus\fR
.RS 4
Show current status\&.
.RE
.SH "RDP COMMANDS"
.PP
\fBrdp\fR \fBenable\fR
.RS 4
Enable the RDP backend\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBrdp\fR \fBdisable\fR
.RS 4
Disable the RDP backend\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBrdp\fR \fBset\-auth\-methods\fR \fIAUTH\-METHOD\&...\fR
.RS 4
Set a comma separated list of authentication methods\&. Available methods are
\fIcredentials\fR
and
\fIkerberos\fR\&. The
\fIkerberos\fR
method is only supported by the headless and screen share runtime modes\&. At least one auth method must be set\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBrdp\fR \fBset\-tls\-cert\fR \fITLS\-CERT\fR
.RS 4
Set path to TLS certificate\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBrdp\fR \fBset\-tls\-key\fR \fITLS\-KEY\fR
.RS 4
Set path to TLS key\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBrdp\fR \fBset\-kerberos\-keytab\fR \fIKERBEROS\-KEY\-TAB\fR
.RS 4
Set the path to a Kerberos keytab\&. When configured with the
\fIkerberos\fR
auth method, this keytab will be used for authenticating remote users\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBrdp\fR \fBset\-credentials\fR \fIUSERNAME\fR \fIPASSWORD\fR
.RS 4
Set username and password credentials\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBrdp\fR \fBclear\-credentials\fR
.RS 4
Clear username and password credentials\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBrdp\fR \fBenable\-view\-only\fR
.RS 4
Disable remote control of input devices\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBrdp\fR \fBdisable\-view\-only\fR
.RS 4
Enable remote control of input devices\&.
.RE
.SH "VNC COMMANDS"
.PP
\fBvnc\fR \fBenable\fR
.RS 4
Enable the VNC backend\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBvnc\fR \fBdisable\fR
.RS 4
Disable the VNC backend\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBvnc\fR \fBset\-password\fR \fIPASSWORD\fR
.RS 4
Set the VNC password\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBvnc\fR \fBclear\-password\fR
.RS 4
Clear the VNC password\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBvnc\fR \fBset\-auth\-method\fR \fIAUTH\-METHOD\fR
.RS 4
Set the authentication method used for new VNC connections\&. Can be either
\fBpassword\fR
or
\fBprompt\fR\&.
.RE
.sp
\fBvnc\fR \fBenable\-view\-only\fR: Disable remote control of input devices\&.
.PP
\fBvnc\fR \fBdisable\-view\-only\fR
.RS 4
Enable remote control of input devices\&.
.RE
.SH "اشکالات (BUGS)"
.sp
The bug tracker can be reached by visiting the website \m[blue]\fBhttps://gitlab\&.gnome\&.org/GNOME/gnome\-remote\-desktop/issues\fR\m[]\&. Before sending a bug report, please verify that you have the latest version of gnome\-remote\-desktop\&. Many bugs (major and minor) are fixed at each release, and if yours is out of date, the problem may already have been solved\&.
